                                                "example_id": "8cce1c56-8375-4480-81ae-34b39f7aeb86",
                                                "sense_id": "accb178e-8e0c-39c0-aa7c-d7b2def5a0f5",
                                                "text": "The value of the peso has plummeted 858% against the US dollar over the past five years as the central bank printed more of the currency to help the country’s spendthrift government avoid defaulting on its debts. […] To dollarize its economy, Argentina would need to exchange all pesos held by its people and businesses for US dollars, and assign a dollar value to all of its assets and contracts."
                                            }
